  "limitations": [
    "Only the pinned NVIDIA SimReady package family is prepared; this is not a general converter.",
    "Only the Newton physics variant and UsdPreviewSurface fallback materials are used; MDL shading is not reproduced.",
    "MDL files may import NVIDIA core libraries outside the source package; that render path is reported, not executed.",
